00001: {"id":"R001","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/003_Move/001_Battle_Move.rb","range":[1,201],"facts":["Constructor snapshots battle move data, PP and effect chance, clones flags but holds underlying Pokemon move for totals/display. Factory accepts Pokemon::Move, nil code uses None, digit-prefixed codes use legacy effect namespace, unresolved legal effect implementation falls back to Unimplemented. A fallback is not an unknown move ID.","Total PP uses positive override, else underlying move, else zero. Physical/special reads configured category or calculated/base type; missing type becomes physical. Damage/status predicate still reads category. Default capability predicates false except burn reduction true. Flags match case insensitive full token. Sound or active Infiltrator bypass Substitute only at generation >=6.","Morpeko specific form/TransformSpecies display type uses battle base type; all other display properties delegate underlying Pokemon move. Commented display formula branches do not execute. Display type/damage/category are distinct from actual calcType, power and category choices."],"spec":["wp43 §§2,2.1,3.1","wp47-a attributes and calling"]}
00002: {"id":"R002","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/003_Move/002_Move_Usage.rb","range":[1,405],"facts":["Usage resets Fury Cutter, Parental Bond, Protect rate, Fusion fields. Parental Bond default hit number is two only active ability + damaging now + noncharging move + exactly one target, writes count3; Long Reach suppresses contact. Main generic callbacks are empty/default false and caller ordering must come from Battler.","Ability immunity skips under Mold Breaker. Last-in-round looks for other unmoved UseMove/Shift; already-moved target rejects every other choice or moved target. Aroma Veil checks target then allies, under Mold Breaker none; splash affects message presentation only.","Absorption priority is others Substitute, Eiscue Ice Face physical with raw ability+form/species checks, then Mimikyu Disguise. Substitute loss capped at substitute HP, accumulates total; disguise/iceface prevent ordinary direct HP loss. Ordinary lethal damage clips HP, then nonlethal, Endure, then fullHP-only Sturdy/Sash/Band/affection chain; Band and affection share fullHP gate. hpLost and cumulative total are assigned before HP submission.","Only substitute effect or positive real HP loss submits. Animations group allied then opposing targets and consume already-submitted HP state; unaffected/zero loss excluded. Fixed damage/disguise/iceface suppress effectiveness messaging; multi-hit/Parental Bond alters timing. Substitute fade occurs after damage. Disguise gen8 bust costs floor totalHP/8 via ordinary ReduceHP; Sash consumption happens in survival message; Band persists.","RecordDamageLost stores physical Counter or special Mirror Coat only without substitute; legacy type-based Hidden Power forced Normal for this categorisation. Bide includes damage from substitute too. All damage history fields, foe-specific arrays, focus punch/Assurance flags and player statistics are separately updated."],"spec":["wp43 §§7","wp46 damage/multihit","wp47-b control"]}
00003: {"id":"R003","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/003_Move/003_Move_UsageCalculations.rb","range":[1,515],"facts":["Base type ability first; Ion Deluge Normal to Electric then Electrify when Electric registered, both remove ability powerBoost. Effectiveness from defender types: immunity restoration Ring Target/Scrappy-Foresight/MiracleEye; StrongWinds Flying weakness neutral; grounded Flying neutral to Ground. Active IronBall + Flying target + Ground returns whole neutral before other types. Shadow replaces ordinary multiplication; TarShot doubles Fire after ordinary types.","Accuracy early Telekinesis/Minimize gen6/zero base bypass modifiers. Modifier order user ability, allies, target ability under MoldBreaker gate, both items, Gravity, Micle consume, positive evasion removal. Separate clamped stage percentages round with multipliers; threshold integer division for integer base; strict random comparison. Affection target5 notMega internal/player changes threshold minus10 and flag only on old threshold hit.","Critical LuckyChant first; user/target abilities and items, negative stops later callbacks; move override then >50 marker/LaserFocus then flags/FocusEnergy/HyperMode original Shadow. New denominators24,8,2,1; old16,8,4,3,2; clamp high; ratio1 no draw. Affection uses user ownership/level but target mega exclusion, random1 marks affection critical.","Damage skips status; disguise/iceface sets calc1 before critical or randomness. Current attack/defense getters provide stages; opposite Unaware omits appropriate stage application, crit ignores only unfavourable stages. Power/attack/defense multipliers independently round and clamp1; nested floor level coefficient/product/div50 then +2; final multiplier round clamp1.","Modifiers ordered aura, user ability, allies/target unless MoldBreaker, nonignorable target, target allies unless MoldBreaker, user/target items; parental second-hit power fraction generation4/2, MeFirst/help/Charge, both battler/field sports independently divide3, terrain user qualification or Misty target, badges internal/player threshold, spread target list >1, user effectiveweather, crit, random16 except Confusion, STAB, typeMod, burn/Guts, noncrit/nonInfiltrator wall priority Aurora then Reflect/LightScreen with alive side count, Minimize damage double irrespective gen6, move power and final callbacks.","Additional effect ShieldDust first; explicit positive probability else move data; >100 early preserved; SereneGrace OR rainbow double once subject gen/environment exception; debugCtrl100 after that. Added flinch excludes own flinch moves, ShieldDust; Stench or item10%, doubles once for grace/rainbow, caller must exclude faint/substitute."],"spec":["wp43 §§3-7"]}
00004: {"id":"R004","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/003_Move/004_Move_BaseEffects.rb","range":[1,626],"facts":["Unimplemented status fails, damaging falls through. Confusion pseudo data typeless physical40,no crit,negativePP; Struggle typeless physical50,zeroaccuracy,no real move,Contact+CanProtect, after unaffected gate recoil round quarter maxHP and itemheal.","StatUp single/multi fail only status if no raisable stat; general status submits; damaging additional submits self boosts. StatDown self penalties occur on dealing damage only if opposing party not all fainted. Target statdown status validates, additional excludes substitute; multi failures distinguish Contrary max and other immunity, then MirrorArmor can reflect each drop using recipient eligibility and one splash.","FixedDamage assigns max1 and critical false. TwoTurn computes charging/damaging flags from current effect and PowerHerb; skip charges possible yet both charging+damage true; quick charge invokes charging effects then consumes herb, suppresses UseItem animation for invulnerable families. Charging skips accuracy and ordinary damage; charging/attack effects and animation differ.","Healing base fullHP fails, heal amount via recipient routine and message. Recoil excludes unaffected, no indirect damage, RockHead; clamp1 and itemheal. Protect preserves prior rate across generic reset, duplicate/failed roll/last-in-round reset1; side moves gen6 skip consecutive roll but still rate multiplies3 (older2); effect boolean then message.","Weather base refuses primordial weather, StrongWinds, same weather; delegates duration to pbStartWeather. Pledge checks previous FirstPledge or next eligible ally choice, combination data sets type/animation; setup suppresses damage/animation and marks lastMoveFailed, schedules ally MoveNext and first code. Combined power doubles, sets SeaOfFire/Rainbow/Swamp4 only if absent, own/opposing scope and animations appropriate."],"spec":["wp43 §2.1","wp44 stat stages","wp46 damage/heal/multihit","wp47-b protection","COM-CORE weather/pledge"]}
00005: {"id":"R014","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/007_Other battle code/001_PBEffects.rb","range":[1,178],"facts":["Complete storage namespace: battler flags/counters/indexes0..116; position FutureSight/Wish/HealingWish/LunarDance700..708; side barriers/hazards/pledges800..821; field environmental counters900..912. IDs provide slot identities only, no initializer/duration/consumer semantics. All named move writers matched scope; consumer reception remains required."],"spec":["wp43 damage state","wp44 status","wp46 delayed healing","wp47 effect scope"]}
00006: {"id":"R015","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/007_Other battle code/003_Battle_DamageState.rb","range":[1,61],"facts":["Reset entire use clears typeMod/unaffected/protected/miss/reflect flags,total loss/faint then per-hit fields. Per-hit reset clears calculated/planned damage,crit,absorption,survival,berry but retains use-wide type/missed/protection/history fields. This supports repeat hits preserving first success and cumulative loss."],"spec":["wp43 §7","wp46 multihit"]}
00007: {"id":"R005","path":"Data/Scripts/011_Battle/003_Move/005_MoveEffects_Misc.rb","range":[1,693],"facts":["None adds no behavior. Celebrate message wild bearer or trainer owner. HoldHands requires ally and ignores substitute. Splash flagged gravity unusable, nothing-happened message. PayDay only player-owned user accumulates 5*currentlevel per use; HappyHour only nonopposing side true. FirstImpression turnCount>1 fails; LastResort requires itself known, another move and all others used; Belch both command and actual gate belched state; Poltergeist requires held+active item; Synchronoise intersects full types.","FocusPunch charge writes flag, suppresses use message and fails only flag+tookMoveDamage. SuckerPunch target UseMove and nonnil; MeFirst function exception ignores moved/status test. Crash excludes indirect-immune, takes floor maxHP/2, heals held item then faint. Weather four subclasses only assign weather, terrain four fail if same and delegate StartTerrain; SteelRoller fails None then removes stored terrain.","Hazards Spikes max3,ToxicSpikes max2,StealthRock/StickyWeb bool each reflectable. CourtChange swaps precisely 11 numeric effects and2 boolean hazard effects, fails if all absent, excludes other side effects.","Substitute costs max(floorHP/4,1), hp must exceed cost, failure sets @subLife; OnStart deducts then itemheal, general clears trapping count/move and sets substitute life. RapidSpin after user alive+target affected clears own trapping/source,seed and four hazards; speed+1 only gen8 additional effect. FutureSight setup is nondamaging, always accurate setup, rejects occupied position, stores counter3 move/user index and party index; damage use invokes normal path with battle.futureSight. AllySwitch exactly one nearby same-owner ally, swap then entry-position callbacks. BeakBlast charge only writes pending contact-burn flag."],"spec":["wp43 fallback/damage","wp46 delayed/misc damage","wp47-b control","COM-CORE environment/hazards/money"]}
